  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ItemData
  itemName: SUBJECT 003 REPORT - 27.8.07
  itemDescription: A protector stepping into his role
  fullNoteContent: "SUBJECT 003: Howard Clark - Weekly Report By: DR. J. Rogers\n\nObservations:\n\nSubject
    has made significant progress in the past few months, despite the radical physical
    changes to his body caused by his assimilation, tests indicate that he is healthy
    physically and has essentially returned to normal function, well as close to
    normal as he can in his new state.However the same cannot be said for his mental
    state, the subject has stopped responding to his birth name and almost exclusively
    refers to himself as \u201CThe Protector\u201D and his behavior makes one see
    why he is dubbed that.The limited interaction he\u2019s had with our captured
    specimen seem to show that they look up to him and he has certainly accepted
    that role, Clark is protective of them and they follow his every word, where
    subjects 001 and 002 see the specimen more as their lesser, Clark treats them
    closer to soldiers with whom he has a close bond.And as for 001 and 002 the three
    seem to treat each other closer to \u201Cequals\u201D and get on surprisingly
    well with each other, but make no mistake they still do have somewhat of a power
    hierarchy amongst the three of them, with subject 001, of course, being at the
    top.Conclusion:\n\nI think we should hold off on further assimilation, considering
    the three wildly different results we\u2019ve seen up to this point it\u2019s
    too risky of a procedure to pull off at this point of time and witnessing Clark\u2019s
    transformation has just further cemented this for me.\n- Signed Dr. Jess Rogers"
  type: 1
  icon: {fileID: 0}
